Package: tenniscareer
Title: Career Matches and Age-Gap Plots from Tennis Abstract
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Minqi (Minchee)", "Yang", , "myang49@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads the career matches of a tennis player from
    tennisabstract.com, returns a clean data frame, and draws a scatter plot of
    the age difference between the player and the opponent against the age of
    the player.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
